  "alt": "Moving from a 384-dimension embedding to a 3072-dimension embedding gives the bi-encoder eight times the dimensions, but it still compresses the query and the document separately, so the larger vector is still marked as failing to compare them together. The cross-encoder after it remains the step that reads both at once.",
  "caption": "Eight times the dimensions still compresses each text alone, so the reranker stays.",
